---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "Privacy Policy | Mortgage Broker Miami Florida";
const description = "Explain how lead form information, calls, texts, analytics, and website data may be used. Have counsel review before launch.";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Trust + compliance</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Explain how lead form information, calls, texts, analytics, and website data may be used. Have counsel review before launch.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="contact.html">Contact</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">Matthew Gromadzki</span><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span><span class="trust-pill">Review before launch</span></div></div><div class="hero-panel rate-card"><div class="rate-item"><span>Purpose</span><strong>Trust + compliance</strong></div><div class="rate-item"><span>Status</span><strong>Review before launch</strong></div><div class="rate-item"><span>Use</span><strong>Website credibility</strong></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><h2>Recommended production content</h2><p>This page should be finalized before launch so the site has stronger trust and compliance support. Replace placeholder language with exact business disclosures, review widgets, privacy language, and legal notices that apply to the live business.</p><h2>What to include</h2><ul class="check-grid"><li>NMLS/license details</li><li>Business contact information</li><li>No guarantee language</li><li>Lead form consent language</li><li>Rate and calculator disclaimers</li><li>Real review policy</li></ul></article><aside></aside></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="cta-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">Trust next step</p><h2>Verify the business and then request a scenario review.</h2><p>Trust and compliance pages should support, not replace, the main quote and preapproval paths.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="about.html">About Matthew</a></div></div></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
